# GitHub Linguist Language Override
# Force Python as the primary language by excluding JavaScript, HTML, CSS, and compiled distribution assets

*.js linguist-vendored
*.jsx linguist-vendored
*.css linguist-vendored
*.html linguist-vendored
*.json linguist-vendored

docs/** linguist-vendored
frontend/** linguist-vendored

*.py linguist-vendored=false
*.py linguist-detectable=true
